# Codeplaces Environment Variables

# Backend API URL (Vercel Serverless API)
# If left empty, Codeplaces executes JavaScript in-browser and connects directly to code execution services.
# When deploying your backend to Vercel, set this to your Vercel deployment URL (e.g., https://your-app.vercel.app)
VITE_API_URL=https://codeplaces.vercel.app